 "syllabus": {
  "description_paragraphs": [
   "This course prepares students for corporate life and global citizenship by fostering overall personal and professional development. It develops skills in creative problem-solving, structured thinking, effective communication, teamwork, cultural awareness, and conflict resolution, while enhancing decision-making, emotional intelligence, and the ability to overcome challenges.",
   "<b>In-course project:</b> The in-course project is integrated into the course and not offered separately. Students work in teams to analyze workplace challenges, address real-world problems in professional environments, and propose practical, well-reasoned solutions using concepts and frameworks covered in the course.t",
   "<b>Lectures-Tutorials-Practicals-Credits:</b> 4-0-0-4"
  ],
  "faculty": [
   "Prof. Sivakumar M S, Department of Applied Mechanics, IIT Madras",
